ttack-opposition-campaign-rally-in-lagos/a-79934958?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A group of men armed with axes, clubs and machetes have reportedly attacked an opposition rally in the run-up to presidential elections. Journalists were also attacked as victims pointed fingers at the ruling APC party.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Kenya's last Ebola patient leaves hospital</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0eee6c28809e3c70ce7b31d2a37a6b8ea457098896de50b8ab9357be5414c06f</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T16:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/kenya-s-last-ebola-patient-leaves-hospital/a-79921240--e9705d91e6bb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/kenya-s-last-ebola-patient-leaves-hospital/a-79921240?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Kenya had nine confirmed cases, while DR Congo continues to battle its deadliest outbreak of the disease.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Wael Mohya could make German football history at 17</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:20672002626114fba9573e25626b1a4cdc0642454d19ccc5aacedec002b53bcf</id><updated>2026-11-13T16:33:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T15:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787--677b2c671ea6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wael-mohya-could-make-german-football-history-at-17/a-79919787?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At just 17, Gladbach forward Wael Mohya has earned his first Germany call-up. The dual-national talent has chosen the DFB path for now — and could soon make modern national-team history.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Controversial kinship: From colonial rule to the Holocaust?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8a9f3d5e84ef4570563b7e229b4af62155